     1	"""Bounded Gateway-only nominal coordinator, GET-only unless separately enabled.
     2	
     3	CapApplied means a guarded Gateway admission-budget ACK, never Native token
     4	application. The precommit GET is not ledger CAS. Planner read_state returns
     5	the last actually GET-observed version, not a simultaneous remote observation.
     6	
     7	Use the same journal across restarts. Its count and episode deadline never
     8	reset; deleting/replacing it is outside this trusted-operator contract.
     9	Clock, planner and HTTP deadlines are cooperative, not OS hard preemption.
    10	Fixed/FIFO benchmark setup is deliberately absent: a strong Fixed baseline
    11	must install its frozen observed-TRAIN cap before offers, not use this loop.
    12	"""
    13	
